# Source material for books, including unpublished research.
#
# Book-ideas/ holds manuscripts and data belonging to real people — the DNP
# capstone in here names its author, her supervising professor, and the
# facility the project ran in. None of it is the application's to distribute,
# and `railway up` would otherwise ship it to a deployed service.
/Book-ideas/
